    "description": "Shelflife Online Store presents the Thug Club x adidas Adiform Megaride - Core Black/Silver Metallic - KI9522.\r\n\r\nStep into bold street style with the Thug Club x adidas Adiform Megaride, where heritage meets modern urban flair. Featuring a sleek leather upper with iconic 3-Stripes and Trefoil branding, these trainers are designed to make a statement while staying true to adidas Originals\u2019 rebellious spirit.\r\n\r\nBuilt with Cold Cement construction, the Adiform Megaride offers durable comfort for everyday wear. The lace closure ensures a secure fit, while the textile sockliner adds softness against your skin. A rubber outsole provides reliable traction and stability, making these sneakers perfect for city streets, casual outings, or completing your streetwear rotation.",
